{"synopsis":"Terlahir kembali di alam baru, seorang ahli nutrisi jenius bangkit—bukan dengan pedang atau sihir, melainkan dengan pengetahuan, cita rasa, dan ambisi yang tak terbendung. Berbekal ilmu kuliner modern, ia siap mengubah bahan-bahan sederhana menjadi sebuah kerajaan yang lezat.\n\nDari dapur kecil yang sederhana, percikan awal penaklukan yang tak biasa pun dimulai—\nSebuah penaklukan kerajaan melalui rasa.\n\nSebuah pengambilalihan yang digerakkan oleh inovasi, strategi, dan kreasi menggugah selera yang belum pernah dibayangkan dunia ini sebelumnya.\n\nBersiaplah untuk pesta ambisi, transformasi, dan cita rasa yang mengubah takdir itu sendiri.\n\nSelamat datang di Evergreen.","alternative_title":"이세계 영주가 밥을 잘 먹임","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"cd14f316-35cc-4d91-af65-4a5772d3ea8a","date":"2026-08-02","images":[]},{"number":"27","chapter":"27","slug":"54434c4e-d02e-4543-bb14-388e962e62f2","date":"2026-07-26","images":[]},{"number":"26","chapter":"26","slug":"91fb842c-5830-4d33-bd8c-61f0150249ea","date":"2026-07-25","images":[]},{"number":"25","chapter":"25","slug":"1027d17e-f924-4490-bebf-09709673e4f3","date":"2026-07-10","images":[]},{"number":"24","chapter":"24","slug":"deccad43-6c5c-42e6-b46a-19f153366781","date":"2026-07-06","images":[]},{"number":"23","chapter":"23","slug":"d31d1dca-014d-4ea4-a149-1cebc30d2ed4","date":"2026-07-02","images":[]},{"number":"22","chapter":"22","slug":"a7e07fd3-0d96-4c01-9a16-42f10b6c2fcd","date":"2026-06-28","images":[]},{"number":"21","chapter":"21","slug":"9e35b85e-4a4e-4d5d-9e31-57c7525b3089","date":"2026-06-22","images":[]},{"number":"20","chapter":"20","slug":"0f175034-d340-4355-9c5a-582c105fae99","date":"2026-06-16","images":[]},{"number":"19","chapter":"19","slug":"6945dbb8-469c-4197-a3b7-c37ab74f544a","date":"2026-05-26","images":[]},{"number":"18","chapter":"18","slug":"37ac13a8-1dd9-4591-b723-2d99beb3db9d","date":"2026-05-20","images":[]},{"number":"17",